{"seq":2,"slug":"horizontal-vertical","title":"横向重排与纵向分层","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-audio/adaptive-music/horizontal-vertical","wordCount":1321,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"横向重排与纵向分层\">横向重排与纵向分层</h1><p>把同一段战斗乐&quot;加一层鼓就更紧张&quot;，和&quot;从探索乐整段换成战斗乐&quot;，听起来都是&quot;音乐变了&quot;，但底层是两种完全不同的机制。前者在垂直方向上叠加声部，后者在水平时间轴上切换段落。这两种技法——纵向分层与横向重排——是<a href=\"adaptive-systems\">自适应音乐系统</a>总框架下的两根支柱。本篇把它们各自的原理、素材要求、过渡处理讲透，并说明如何组合使用；它们绑定到具体游戏状态的方式由<a href=\"music-game-state\">音乐与游戏状态绑定</a>接续。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>用一张图直观对比两者改变音乐的方向：纵向分层在同一时刻沿&quot;层&quot;的轴增减，横向重排沿&quot;时间&quot;的轴跳转。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[当前游戏状态] --&gt; B[纵向分层 Vertical]&#10;  A --&gt; C[横向重排 Horizontal]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[层1 节奏垫底&lt;br/&gt;始终在]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[层2 旋律&lt;br/&gt;张力中加入]&#10;  B --&gt; B3[层3 铜管打击&lt;br/&gt;高张力加入]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[段A 探索]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[段B 战斗]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[段C 胜利]&#10;  C1 --&gt;|事件触发&lt;br/&gt;量化切换| C2&#10;  C2 --&gt;|事件触发| C3\">graph TD\n  A[当前游戏状态] --&gt; B[纵向分层 Vertical]\n  A --&gt; C[横向重排 Horizontal]\n  B --&gt; B1[层1 节奏垫底&lt;br/&gt;始终在]\n  B --&gt; B2[层2 旋律&lt;br/&gt;张力中加入]\n  B --&gt; B3[层3 铜管打击&lt;br/&gt;高张力加入]\n  C --&gt; C1[段A 探索]\n  C --&gt; C2[段B 战斗]\n  C --&gt; C3[段C 胜利]\n  C1 --&gt;|事件触发&lt;br/&gt;量化切换| C2\n  C2 --&gt;|事件触发| C3</pre><p>记忆口诀：纵向是&quot;加减声部、texture 渐变、流不断&quot;，横向是&quot;跳转段落、整体换、可剧变&quot;。它们对应的素材组织、过渡难度、表达能力都不同。</p>\n<p>适用场景的选择可参照下表，几个常见需求对应的技法是：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>需求</th>\n<th>首选技法</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>战斗中敌人渐多、音乐渐激烈</td>\n<td>纵向分层</td>\n<td>强度连续爬升、流不中断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>从探索区走进战斗区</td>\n<td>横向重排</td>\n<td>需跨越两种截然不同的情绪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Boss 分阶段、每阶段配器不同</td>\n<td>横向重排 + 纵向分层</td>\n<td>阶段间切换、阶段内渐变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>血量越低音乐越紧张</td>\n<td>纵向分层</td>\n<td>单一场景内的连续参数驱动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"纵向分层-同时播-按需增减\">纵向分层：同时播，按需增减</h2><p>纵向分层（vertical layering，也叫 vertical orchestration）的做法是：把同一段音乐编为若干<strong>等长、同调、可叠加</strong>的层（stem），运行时全部同步播放，但通过控制每层的音量来决定哪些层&quot;被听见&quot;。一个常见的强度阶梯：底层恒定的节奏与和声垫，张力升高时淡入旋律层，再高时加入铜管与打击的高潮层。</p>\n<p>它的杀手锏是<strong>流不中断</strong>——音乐的律动、和声、相位始终连续，只是织体在变厚变薄，玩家几乎察觉不到&quot;切换&quot;的发生。《死亡空间 2》就把音乐编成约四层、各对应一个&quot;恐惧等级&quot;，根据玩家与敌人的距离等变量实时混合各层（来源：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adaptive_music\">Wikipedia, Adaptive music</a>）。</p>\n<p>纵向分层与<a href=\"../foundations/interactive-audio-mindset\">交互式音频思维</a>里的参数（RTPC）天然契合：用一个连续的&quot;紧张度&quot;变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 直接驱动各层音量。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 层的增益为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_i(\\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，每层有自己的进入阈值与淡入曲线，例如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_i(\\tau) = \\mathrm{clamp}\\!\\left(\\frac{\\tau - a_i}{b_i - a_i},\\,0,\\,1\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">clamp</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8184em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4451em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，让层随张力平滑地一个个浮现。它对素材的硬要求是所有层严格等长、同 BPM、同和声，否则叠起来会相位错乱或调性打架——这正是<a href=\"adaptive-systems\">自适应音乐系统</a>强调&quot;统一节拍调性&quot;的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"横向重排-切段落-按事件跳转\">横向重排：切段落，按事件跳转</h2><p>横向重排（horizontal resequencing）则是在时间轴上的不同音乐段落之间跳转：探索段、战斗段、胜利段各是独立的乐曲，游戏事件触发从一段跳到另一段（来源：<a href=\"https://www.gamedeveloper.com/audio/horizontal-resequencing-and-dynamic-transitions-for-game-music-composers\">Game Developer, Horizontal resequencing</a>）。</p>\n<p>它的表达力强于纵向——可以让两段音乐在情绪、调性、配器上截然不同，实现戏剧性的转变。代价是过渡更难：从 A 段直接硬切到 B 段往往生硬，所以需要过渡管理。常见的几种过渡策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>量化跳转</strong>：等到当前段落的下一个小节/乐句边界再切，是最低成本的平滑手段。</li>\n<li><strong>过渡片段（transition segment）</strong>：在 A 与 B 之间插入一段专门写的桥接乐句，把听者从一种情绪引渡到另一种。</li>\n<li><strong>交叉淡化（crossfade）</strong>：A 淡出同时 B 淡入，适合调性接近的段落，对差异大的段落易显糊。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"二者对比与组合\">二者对比与组合</h2><p>下表把两种技法的关键属性并列，便于在设计时选型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>纵向分层</th>\n<th>横向重排</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>改变方向</td>\n<td>叠加层（强度/织体）</td>\n<td>跳转段（场景/情绪）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续性</td>\n<td>极强，流不断</td>\n<td>弱，需过渡管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表达力</td>\n<td>同一基调内的渐变</td>\n<td>跨基调的剧变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>素材约束</td>\n<td>各层须等长同调可叠</td>\n<td>各段独立，但需过渡素材</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存代价</td>\n<td>多层同时常驻播放，较高</td>\n<td>一次主要播一段，较省</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最佳场景</td>\n<td>战斗强度爬升、潜行紧张度</td>\n<td>探索↔战斗↔结算的状态切换</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实战几乎都<strong>组合使用</strong>：用横向重排在&quot;探索/战斗/Boss&quot;几个大场景间切换，每个大场景内部再用纵向分层表达本场景的强度起伏。这种&quot;横向分场景、纵向调强度&quot;的两级结构，能用有限的素材覆盖丰富的张力空间，而它如何映射到具体的游戏状态机，正是<a href=\"music-game-state\">音乐与游戏状态绑定</a>的主题。注意纵向分层多层常驻会增加内存与 voice 占用，这笔账要和<a href=\"../implementation/performance-memory\">性能与内存优化</a>一起算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>纵向分层沿&quot;层&quot;轴增减声部：等长同调的层同步播放、靠音量取舍，流不中断，天然契合 RTPC 紧张度变量。</li>\n<li>横向重排沿&quot;时间&quot;轴跳转段落：表达力强、可剧变，但过渡难，靠量化跳转/过渡片段/交叉淡化平滑。</li>\n<li>二者在连续性、表达力、素材约束、内存代价上各有取舍，纵向更费内存。</li>\n<li>实战常组合：横向分大场景、纵向调场景内强度，用有限素材覆盖丰富张力。</li>\n<li>它们到游戏状态机的映射见<a href=\"music-game-state\">音乐与游戏状态绑定</a>，内存代价见<a href=\"../implementation/performance-memory\">性能与内存优化</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"横向重排与纵向分层","id":"横向重排与纵向分层"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"纵向分层：同时播，按需增减","id":"纵向分层-同时播-按需增减"},{"level":2,"text":"横向重排：切段落，按事件跳转","id":"横向重排-切段落-按事件跳转"},{"level":2,"text":"二者对比与组合","id":"二者对比与组合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"自适应音乐系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-audio/adaptive-music/adaptive-systems"},"next":{"title":"音乐与游戏状态绑定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-audio/adaptive-music/music-game-state"}}